<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina sets $8.8 million in overnight repos.</title>
<headline>Argentina sets $8.8 million in overnight repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Thursday it allocated $8.8 million in overnight repurchase agreements.</p>
<p>Call money rose to 7.05 percent from 6.95 percent at the close Wednesday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar was flat at 0.99981 peso from Wednesday.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
